# Workflow (mandatory)

- Do **not** implement product features until `prd/00-product-vision.md` exists and [prd/README.md](prd/README.md) names an active phase.
- Do not invent requirements; use `prd/` and ChatPRD links only.
- Before coding: read [prd/README.md](prd/README.md), then the active `prd/phase-*.md` (or linked ChatPRD doc). If the user names a Linear issue, implement only its acceptance criteria.
- New phase or large epic: propose a milestone plan and wait for approval before editing.
- PRs: use [.github/pull_request_template.md](.github/pull_request_template.md); include Linear ID in the title when applicable; note PRD deviations in the description.

Full playbook (Linear, GitHub, ChatPRD skills, example prompts): [docs/WORKFLOW.md](docs/WORKFLOW.md).
